  "Overview": "F1 2013: Complete Edition includes the full 2013 FIA Formula One World Championship game plus all of its classic content on disc. Alongside the 2013 cars, drivers and circuits, it contains historic cars and drivers from the 1980s and 1990s and the classic Brands Hatch, Imola, Estoril and Jerez circuits. The game includes single-player racing, two-player split-screen, system-link and online multiplayer.",
